{start_of_verse}
[C]Lord, where [C/E]else [C/G]could we [C]go?
[C]Where in the [Am]world [F]would we find [G]joy?
[E/G#]No one, [Am]no person [C/E]can give us [E7]so much [Am]as you [G]do.
[F]You lead us back [E7]into [Am]life.
[Am/G]Only you, [Fmaj7]only you give us [Gsus4]joy in life. [C]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
